<section class="ex-note" id="positioning-equipment">
<h2>5. Patient Positioning &amp; Equipment（擺位與器材）</h2>
<ul>
<li>正確擺位是安全有效移除脂肪的關鍵；擺位方式依部位不同，用來避開重要解剖構造並讓 cannula 最容易到達脂肪堆積處。<span class="ex-ref">p.3906</span></li>
<li>所需器材（Figs. 214-1、214-2）：<span class="ex-ref">p.3906</span>
<ul>
<li>Tumescent local anesthetic solution</li>
<li>Infiltration needles and/or cannulas</li>
<li>Intravenous or peristaltic pump tubing</li>
<li>Infiltration pump</li>
<li>Liposuction cannulas（manual and/or powered）</li>
<li>Aspiration tubing</li>
<li>Aspiration pump with aspirate receptacles</li>
<li>Monitoring device and emergency equipment</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="anesthesia">
<h2>6. Anesthesia（麻醉）</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Lidocaine</strong> 是 tumescent liposuction 的首選麻醉藥；報告為安全的最大劑量是 <strong class="ex-n">55 mg/kg</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3907</span></li>
<li>Vehicle 通常為 normal saline（0.9% sodium chloride）；<strong>sodium bicarbonate</strong> 用來 buffer 溶液；<strong>epinephrine</strong> 用來加強止血並減緩 lidocaine 吸收。<span class="ex-ref">p.3907</span></li>
<li><strong class="ex-n">0.1%</strong> lidocaine（最高濃度）止痛效果較好，適合小範圍或敏感部位；<strong class="ex-n">0.075%</strong> 與 <strong class="ex-n">0.05%</strong> 提供足夠麻醉，用於大範圍或多部位。<span class="ex-ref">p.3907</span></li>
<li>準確記錄 tumescent 溶液的配製與給予量，是避免 lidocaine toxicity 的關鍵。<span class="ex-ref">p.3907</span></li>
</ul>
